<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains liquidity at 23.41 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains liquidity at 23.41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed the single secondary market auction it offered in order to purchase paper and withdraw liquidity.</p>
<p>AUCTION AMOUNT   TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>199 million pesos    1 day    23.48  23.35   23.42    2    2</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
